n\">\n<div class=\"button_box\">\n<button class=\"the_first\">Product Details</button>\n<p><input id=\"productID\" name=\"productID\" type=\"hidden\" value=\"80248639\"/></p><p><strong>4 Inch Deep Well Multisage Impeller Pump</strong><br/></p><p><img src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231513561089815.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"image007(001).jpg\"/></p><p>We supply 4 Inch Deep Well Multisage Impeller Pump. Our products are well exported to Europe, Africa, Asia, South America, covering more than 70 countries. We are expecting become your long-term partner.</p><p><strong>1. Product Parameter (specification)</strong></p><p>C<strong>ategories: </strong>submersible pumps</p><p><strong>Flow </strong>(m3/h): 5.8</p><p><strong>Head</strong> (m): 2 / 450</p><p><strong>Power </strong>(kW): 0.25 / 5.5</p><p><strong>Construction:</strong></p><p>Submersible motor pumps for deep wells of 4″ (DN 100 mm).</p><p>Sized for connection to the motor according to NEMA Standards.</p><p>Delivery casing with built-in non-return valve.</p><p>Delivery port G 1 1/4. Radial floating impeller with high reliability operating in sandy water.</p><p><strong>Performance:</strong></p><p>Capacity up to 5.8 m3/h.</p><p>Head up to 450m.</p><p>Rated motor power output up to 5.5 kW.</p><p>Rotation speed 2850 r.p.m. (motor frequency 50 Hz).</p><p><strong>2. Performance Curve</strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image009(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231515204494387.jpg\"/></strong></p><p><strong><img alt=\"image005(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231513514172586.jpg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/></strong></p><p><strong>3. Spare Parts</strong></p><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"table\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr class=\"firstRow\"><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Plastic Impeller </p><p><img alt=\"image011(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231516129247819.jpg\"/></p><p>·Bearing high flow rate and pressure</p><p>·Protected by the impeller case</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Mechanical Seal</p><p><img alt=\"image013(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231516239884284.jpg\"/></p><p>·No oil-leakage keep the well safe</p><p>·Water and sand proof keep the motor safe</p><p><br/></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Rotor Shaft</p><p><img alt=\"image015(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231516356536376.jpg\"/></p><p>·Extend lifespan of the mechanical seal</p><p>·Extend lifespan of the motor</p><p><br/></p></td><td style=\"\" valign=\"top\" width=\"383\"><p>Bearing </p><p><img alt=\"image017(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231516458615707.jpg\"/></p><p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体\"></span></p><p>·C&amp;U brand, longer working life</p><p>·Motors can run more stable and smoothly</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'Arial','sans-serif'\"></span><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><strong><br/></strong></p><p><br/></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>4. Materials</strong></p><p>Stainless steel external shell</p><p>Stainless steel Motor head</p><p>Stainless steel Coupling joint</p><p>Stainless steel Suction grid and screws</p><p>Floating impellers </p><p>Built-in check valve</p><p>Motor coupling flange according to NEMA standards</p><p><strong>5. Product Application</strong></p><p>The maintenance-free submersible borehole pumps come in a favourable design. Being particularly slim, they are well-suited to installation in:</p><p>Wells</p><p>Discharge tubes</p><p>Water tanks</p><p><img alt=\"image019(001).jpg\" src=\"/Content/upload/2018348866/201808231519349241776.jpg\"/></p><p><strong>6. About Warranty</strong></p><p>1. This warranty does not cover such defects caused by the owner's neglect of instruction manual before operation.</p><p>2. This warranty excludes operation on high/low voltage than specified, tampering with electrical system, voltage surges as a result of lightning or faulty electrical supply.</p><p>3. We will not honor altered or tampered warranty repair coupons or photocopies of the guarantee repair coupons.</p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"productsTags\"> Hot Tags: 4 inch deep well multisage impeller pump, China, suppliers, manufacturers, buy</p>\n<div class=\"ptit\">Related Products</div>\n<ul class=\"rollPro1\">\n<li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/5-submersible-pump/5-submersible-impeller-pump/5-inch-high-head-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"5 Inch High Head Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/bore-hole-submersible-pump25347264017a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/5-submersible-pump/5-submersible-impeller-pump/5-inch-high-head-submersible-pump\">5 Inch High Head Submersible Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/ss-submersible-sewage-pump-with-float-switch/centrifugal-submersible-drainage-pump\"><img alt=\"Centrifugal Submersible Drainage Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/centrifugal-submersible-sewage-pump38086310076a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/sewage-submersible-pump/ss-submersible-sewage-pump-with-float-switch/centrifugal-submersible-drainage-pump\">Centrifugal Submersible Drainage Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4sr-4-deep-well-submersible-pump/submersible-irrigation-pump\"><img alt=\"Submersible Irrigation Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/submersible-irrigation-pump43409049888a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4sr-4-deep-well-submersible-pump/submersible-irrigation-pump\">Submersible Irrigation Pump</a></p>\n</li><li>\n<div class=\"pbox\"><a href=\"/4-submersible-pump/4sr-4-deep-well-submersible-pump/electric-submersible-pump\"><img alt=\"Electric Submersible Pump\" border=\"0\" src=\"/uploads/201816806/small/electric-submersible-pump03330558400a77d.jpg?size=263x0\"/></a></div>\n<p><a